{
    "word": "listenership",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "41bf6318-99c9-34c0-9b7a-bad6d4c9827b",
                "word": "listenership",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c4a115d3-5b53-4bb6-9a41-74fc9aa97b3a",
                        "entry_id": "41bf6318-99c9-34c0-9b7a-bad6d4c9827b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "listenerships"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                        "entry_id": "41bf6318-99c9-34c0-9b7a-bad6d4c9827b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The audience that listens to a certain form or genre of audio material (specifically (Internet, radio), an audio broadcast such as a radio program or a podcast)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "40fff5de-f3ae-4028-9b26-65ec29e3857a",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "While Soviet jamming is intense, particularly in the vicinity of Moscow, we have evidence that \"Voice [of America]\" programs can be heard in areas 25 miles from Moscow and that there are listeners in numerous cities throughout the Soviet Union. Listenership in the satellites, according to refugees, is widespread."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ef05906-df43-4244-9311-d31a31d8bab6",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "[A]n increase in VOA [Voice of America] audience size may well have been concealed by a change in recording listenership. In all, VOA tied for third in listenership among foreign stations."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "93d5ffec-6410-4b6c-a8c4-b28cf5f1e6b2",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "In the late sixties, as if the result of some galactic explosion, the popular idiom splintered and broke into so many components that a microscopic analysis of each is a difficult if not Herculean task. The cause of this diffusion can be traced to several sources. One was the rapid acceleration and increasing listenership to FM radio, whose alternative programming deviated from hard-rock to progressive country & western, from album cuts to singles, from lush strings to neo-jazz, and away from banal top-forty disc jockeys towards mellowed diplomats who were more influenced by orchestration than sensation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "daa9755f-9c18-42c9-a270-1951766a8548",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "On the other hand, listenership figures from SABC [...] indicate that Radio Metro, an English-medium music programme oriented to urban blacks has one of the highest listenerships of all stations among blacks."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c11d766b-6d2f-44e6-ad77-b65c4a041d92",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "What people \"want\" to read in newspapers, see on television and in films, and listen to over the radio is made available to them by the media owners and their managers. The main objective is to make continuous efforts to increase readership/viewership/listenership so that revenue of advertisements could be attracted."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cc8a7ee3-0607-4405-a9ba-31356d8fb157",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "The American research confirmed the figure of 35 million as the average listenership of the station within Nigeria."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "638feb52-2347-459d-92a8-a72e036745f5",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "As long-time owners of an independent theater chain who were now in search of inexpensive, reliable content that would capture a young listenership for their fledgling radio network, [George Washington] Trendle and [John H.] Kunsky likely thought the Western was the kind of low-risk, high-reward genre KTBC was in search of."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e55fec5-bce1-4793-b3ba-62bac561736a",
                                "sense_id": "91acb69e-dd38-3373-a5bd-a8bb435d8d18",
                                "text": "As noted earlier, Black musics including the blues have not had solely Black listenerships, or remained entirely Black practices: others have been captivated by these musics, contributed to their histories, and benefitted financially from them."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "79893e35-a127-324a-9775-5ecc11f13b86",
                        "entry_id": "41bf6318-99c9-34c0-9b7a-bad6d4c9827b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The act of paying attention to a conversation or speech; listening."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4746238e-1b89-40f9-8513-90bde27175f8",
                                "sense_id": "79893e35-a127-324a-9775-5ecc11f13b86",
                                "text": "Following are the main features found in the talk of three of the six Thanksgiving celebrants. [...] 3. Pacing. (a) faster rate of speech, (b) inter-turn pauses avoided (silence is evidence of lack of rapport), (c) faster turntaking, (d) cooperative overlap and participatory listenership."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "7a66fb06-7adb-48cc-b553-8007694fc169",
                                "sense_id": "79893e35-a127-324a-9775-5ecc11f13b86",
                                "text": "Marsha refers to the characteristic which Pam identified, showing verbal agreement, as \"a bad habit,\" claiming that rather than showing good listenership, it often masks not listening (\"tune 'em out\")."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fb12cf63-a76f-4b3d-beb2-82122f783088",
                                "sense_id": "79893e35-a127-324a-9775-5ecc11f13b86",
                                "text": "These categories form a continuum that shows the degree of floor control, i.e. the left end of the continuum indicates that the speaker has little floor control and is more likely to engage in listenership, while the right end of the continuum shows strong influence on floor control (the speaker can dominate the floor, taking away the floor from the previous speaker)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b78c2ef9-ee92-4af9-87e4-6d785e5a089e",
                                "sense_id": "79893e35-a127-324a-9775-5ecc11f13b86",
                                "text": "[W]omen tend to provide and expect more listener feedback such as \"yeah,\" \"mhm,\" and \"uhuh,\" so they often get the mistaken impression that men are not listening when they are, while men often mistake women's signs of listenership for signs of agreement, and feel misled when they later learn that the women did not agree."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c3fe2cb1-6116-4448-8416-d40d911ec6fa",
                        "source_entry_id": "41bf6318-99c9-34c0-9b7a-bad6d4c9827b",
                        "source_sense_description": "audience that listens to an audio broadcast",
                        "target_lang_word": "audience",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "audience",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8637641d-f82b-36f5-b4eb-6d25e5d46d91",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Attention donnée à la personne qui parle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02f39ede-2f7f-4a88-b7dd-bf497b0a06f5",
                                                "sense_id": "8637641d-f82b-36f5-b4eb-6d25e5d46d91",
                                                "text": "Pourrais-je avoir un moment d’audience ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8a68a893-f593-45a6-8f04-702f1dec55a0",
                                                "sense_id": "8637641d-f82b-36f5-b4eb-6d25e5d46d91",
                                                "text": "Sa vanité de jeune homme l’avertissait bien, de temps à autre, que le silence continu dans lequel il se renfermait avec délice n’était pas fait pour augmenter sa réputation d’homme aimable ; mais il était si étonné, si transporté, qu’il n’avait pas le courage de donner une audience sérieuse au soin de sa gloire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79a5e0bc-4828-37ba-939f-d062ed5e9ebc",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réception où l’on admet quelqu’un dans le but de l’écouter."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fbc4af0-07be-4ad4-be9b-6ccbd926ce7b",
                                                "sense_id": "79a5e0bc-4828-37ba-939f-d062ed5e9ebc",
                                                "text": "Nous eûmes dans la matinée une audience publique du vice-roi. […]. Il nous reçut poliment , accorda au capitaine la relâche , et aux passagers la permission de se promener en ville. Après l’audience nous fîmes des visites militaires et nous revîmes dîner à bord."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b96eae03-9060-3a37-ab1b-cb3eb21167aa",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Réception d'un ambassadeur par les autorités politiques du pays dans lequel il est en poste dans un but de courtoisie ou afin de soulever un point de politique étrangère. L'acceptation d'une audience par les autorités politiques donne lieu à la préparation d'un dossier d'audience en ambassade afin de préparer l'ambassadeur. Au terme de l'audience, un rapport est rédigé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "specifically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d380328a-0ee6-342f-bbef-c72473a23800",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Séance d’un tribunal, d’une commission d’enquête, dans laquelle les juges écoutent les débats."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcca5b75-0633-4c2c-ae0c-e1e5f392b7fa",
                                                "sense_id": "d380328a-0ee6-342f-bbef-c72473a23800",
                                                "text": "Sera-t-il jugé en audience publique ou à huis clos ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0bbc812-c9cb-46a2-a48a-0e709538e483",
                                                "sense_id": "d380328a-0ee6-342f-bbef-c72473a23800",
                                                "text": "L’audience est levée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84c66b40-268e-42a7-aad1-ce02bc541468",
                                                "sense_id": "d380328a-0ee6-342f-bbef-c72473a23800",
                                                "text": "\"C'est l'illustration de cette culture française de la caricature\", salue Aurel, en précisant que le dessin de presse se déploie aussi avec succès sous la forme du croquis d’audience."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1523da19-6a8f-3547-8a79-010d6a4cc9d6",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ceux à qui on donne audience, ou qui assistent à une audience. On dira plutôt auditoire aujourd’hui,"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "note": "Au Québec ce sens est resté",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d41e742e-2962-4b77-97a8-b8d7c1a7c9ec",
                                                "sense_id": "1523da19-6a8f-3547-8a79-010d6a4cc9d6",
                                                "text": "Toute l’audience en fut scandalisée, en fut émerveillée."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4c6f33da-8a00-3c6c-a1f3-bd16c466f999",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ensemble des personnes exposées à un média, considéré quantitativement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57040e3f-7430-4a8e-8c7d-15f6a3f366d5",
                                                "sense_id": "4c6f33da-8a00-3c6c-a1f3-bd16c466f999",
                                                "text": "En cette fin de XIXᵉ siècle, « L’Usine » tient sa ligne éditoriale et son business-model, mais n’a pas encore trouvé son audience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acbaac46-d93d-4970-ad93-01a28e38cead",
                                                "sense_id": "4c6f33da-8a00-3c6c-a1f3-bd16c466f999",
                                                "text": "L’audience d’une émission de radio ou de télévision."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "973c8b38-b6de-32c4-b58d-e7c2f610182a",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Nom de certains tribunaux d’Espagne."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d60c2f81-6b38-4991-b43c-47cbceba80dd",
                                                "sense_id": "973c8b38-b6de-32c4-b58d-e7c2f610182a",
                                                "text": "L’audience nationale est la plus haute instance pénale espagnole."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b83fc895-ae27-3f8f-bfdd-0008084da03b",
                                        "entry_id": "1d4fb83b-ffe1-300e-b23d-8aed89a9c2dc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Administration qui résidait dans les colonies espagnoles ou, par extension, les provinces gouvernées par ces administrations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec863370-a85d-4670-83fc-5ad20c83e1b6",
                                                "sense_id": "b83fc895-ae27-3f8f-bfdd-0008084da03b",
                                                "text": "L’audience de Panama."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b6b4459-043b-49e9-aca6-88b0338d6a56",
                                                "sense_id": "b83fc895-ae27-3f8f-bfdd-0008084da03b",
                                                "text": "Il fallut s’adresser à l’audience de Los Reyes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
